("2","Advance written notice","The member gives notice under the applicable Rules.","process"),
("3","Secretariat scrutiny","The proposal is checked for constitutional/rules requirements and drafting support may be provided.","process"),
("4","Listed for introduction","The Bill is placed in the appropriate Private Members' Business schedule.","schedule"),
("5","Introduction","The member introduces the Bill.","house"),
("6","Committee + consideration","The Bill follows the applicable committee and House stages.","committee"),
("END","Passed / rejected / otherwise disposed of","The House and, where applicable, the other House determine the Bill's outcome.","end"),
