("2","Minister gives notice / sponsors Bill","The Government member initiates the parliamentary process under the Rules.","people"),
("3","Orders of the Day","The Bill is scheduled for Government Business.","schedule"),
("4","Introduction / first stage","The Bill is introduced and enters the applicable legislative process.","house"),
("5","Committee scrutiny","The relevant committee examines the Bill as required.","committee"),
("6","House consideration & vote","The Senate considers, debates, amends where applicable and decides.","decision"),
("7","Other House / President","The Bill follows the applicable two-House and presidential route.","external"),
("END","Act or further parliamentary action","The final outcome is recorded and implemented according to law.","end"),
